      "new_page": true,
      "title": "Executive Summary",
      "text": "Makro missed sales plan by R1.9m (0.31%) but finished R26.8m (4.43%) ahead of last year, while margin fell R15.8m (33.26%) short of plan \u2014 a rate problem far larger than the sales shortfall. Western Cape, Eastern Cape and Mpumalanga drove the sales miss, but Gauteng, despite trading R7.6m ahead of plan on sales, was the single largest regional contributor to the margin miss at R8.0m \u2014 a promotional-intensity problem specific to that region. OTD stood at 90.7% for the period, with Omni Operations explicitly prioritising OTD recovery.",
